{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":66,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华审判万民"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天是我的座位；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地是我的脚凳。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要为我造何等的殿宇？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哪里是我安息的地方呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：这一切都是我手所造的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以就都有了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我所看顾的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是虚心","poem":1},{"noteId":78},{"text":"痛悔、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我话而战兢的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"假冒为善的宰牛，好像杀人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"献羊羔，好像打折狗项，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"献供物，好像献猪血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烧乳香，好像称颂偶像。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这等人拣选自己的道路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心里喜悦行可憎恶的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也必拣选迷惑他们的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们所惧怕的临到他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我呼唤，无人答应；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我说话，他们不听从；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"反倒行我眼中看为恶的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拣选我所不喜悦的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"你们因耶和华言语战兢的人当听他的话：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的弟兄—就是恨恶你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我名赶出你们的，曾说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿耶和华得荣耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我们得见你们的喜乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但蒙羞的究竟是他们！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"有喧哗的声音出自城中！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有声音出于殿中！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是耶和华向仇敌施行报应的声音！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"锡安未曾劬劳就生产，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"未觉疼痛就生出男孩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"国岂能一日而生？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"民岂能一时而产？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为锡安一劬劳便生下儿女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样的事谁曾听见？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁曾看见呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：我既使她临产，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂不使她生产呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的 神说：我既使她生产，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂能使她闭胎不生呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你们爱慕耶路撒冷的","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要与她一同欢喜快乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们为她悲哀的","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要与她一同乐上加乐；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们在她安慰的怀中吃奶得饱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们得她丰盛的荣耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹如挤奶，满心喜乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使平安延及她，好像江河，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列国的荣耀延及她，如同涨溢的河。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要从中享受","poem":1},{"noteId":79},{"text":"；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必蒙抱在肋旁，摇弄在膝上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"母亲怎样安慰儿子，我就照样安慰你们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们也必因","poem":1},{"noteId":80},{"text":"耶路撒冷得安慰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们看见，就心中快乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的骨头必得滋润像嫩草一样；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而且耶和华的手向他仆人所行的必被人知道；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他也要向仇敌发恼恨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"看哪，耶和华必在火中降临；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的车辇像旋风，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以烈怒施行报应，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以火焰施行责罚；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华在一切有血气的人身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必以火与刀施行审判；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被耶和华所杀的必多。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["「那些分别为圣、洁净自己的，进入园内跟在其中一个人的后头，吃猪肉和仓鼠并可憎之物，他们必一同灭绝；这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["「我知道他们的行为和他们的意念。时候将到，我必将万民万族",{"noteId":81},"聚来，看见我的荣耀，"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我要显神迹",{"noteId":82},"在他们中间。逃脱的，我要差到列国去，就是到他施、普勒、拉弓的路德和土巴、雅完，并素来没有听见我名声、没有看见我荣耀辽远的海岛；他们必将我的荣耀传扬在列国中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["他们必将你们的弟兄从列国中送回，使他们或骑马，或坐车，坐轿，骑骡子，骑独峰驼，到我的圣山耶路撒冷，作为供物献给耶和华，好像以色列人用洁净的器皿盛供物奉到耶和华的殿中；这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和华说：我也必从他们中间取人为祭司，为利未人。」"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：我所要造的新天新地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怎样在我面前长存；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的后裔和你们的名字也必照样长存。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每逢月朔、安息日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡有血气的必来在我面前下拜。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必出去观看那些违背我人的尸首；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们的虫是不死的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的火是不灭的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡有血气的都必憎恶他们。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":78,"caller":"-","text":"原文是贫穷","reference":{"chapter":66,"verse":2}},{"noteId":79,"caller":"-","text":"原文是咂","reference":{"chapter":66,"verse":12}},{"noteId":80,"caller":"-","text":"或译：在","reference":{"chapter":66,"verse":13}},{"noteId":81,"caller":"-","text":"族：原文是舌","reference":{"chapter":66,"verse":18}},{"noteId":82,"caller":"-","text":"或译：记号","reference":{"chapter":66,"verse":19}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/65.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}